    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purrgatory is a visual novel about passing time in an afterlife where nothing really matters. Explore a whimsical point-and-click world, get to know its downtrodden inhabitants, and remember \u2014 furever's not so bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/6e89d191c0f08047464e88875bc07257.poster.avif?t=1745973956\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/6e89d191c0f08047464e88875bc07257.apng?t=1745973956\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About Purrgatory</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's a cat in it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Largely LGBTQ+ cast! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3-5 hours of cozy escapism! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 charming and realistic characters! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ hand-drawn locations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too many cat puns to count! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They put it in a museum!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/49f414b70497bc97fbf71dfc3a1869a5.poster.avif?t=1745973956\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/49f414b70497bc97fbf71dfc3a1869a5.gif?t=1745973956\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purrgatory is a visual novel about passing time in an afterlife where nothing really matters. Explore a whimsical point-and-click world, get to know its downtrodden inhabitants, and remember \u2014 furever's not so bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/6e89d191c0f08047464e88875bc07257.poster.avif?t=1745973956\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/6e89d191c0f08047464e88875bc07257.apng?t=1745973956\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About Purrgatory</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's a cat in it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Largely LGBTQ+ cast! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3-5 hours of cozy escapism! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 charming and realistic characters! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ hand-drawn locations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too many cat puns to count! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They put it in a museum!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/49f414b70497bc97fbf71dfc3a1869a5.poster.avif?t=1745973956\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713610/extras/49f414b70497bc97fbf71dfc3a1869a5.gif?t=1745973956\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
